      "description": "What a QA process produced about this folio, published to the qa-reports branch keyed by commit and never committed (owner ruling 2026-10-04, decision 11: QA results go to the cat-harness qa-reports store). It holds what the writers declared under `qa.writers` produce (owner decision 2026-11-24, the integrated QA page): the compute-QA verdicts, one qou-compute-qa/v1 file per gate under compute-qa/ (scripts/compute-qa.py, TOOLS T7, bean qou-4dj1), the Lean vacuity/axiom audit under lean/, and the rendered-paper record under rendering/. Published by .github/workflows/compute-qa.yml (a caller of the platform's layer-qa-publish.yml) and, after a merge, by scripts/qa-publish-local.sh. The directory is gitignored except for a .gitkeep, so it is present in every checkout and a reader never mistakes an absent directory for a clean run. Story S3, bean qou-4rhu.",
